        <mxCell id="glossary" value="中英對照 / Bilingual Glossary&#xa;&#xa;Identity / Alias / Metadata Display = 身分 / 別名 / 主資料顯示&#xa;BLE reachability comes first = 先看 BLE 可達性&#xa;Reality-first read = 以現實為先的讀法&#xa;BLE Scan List = BLE 掃描清單&#xa;discoverable / connectable = 目前可發現 / 可連線&#xa;CC bridge = CC 橋接韌體&#xa;Gateway = 閘道&#xa;End Device = 終端裝置&#xa;live = 即時可用&#xa;Tap to Connect = 點擊連線&#xa;Tap one peer = 點一個對象&#xa;Open active session = 開啟當前工作階段&#xa;One connected peer at a time = 一次只連一個對象&#xa;active session = 單一連線工作階段&#xa;Current Peer Detail = 當前對象詳情&#xa;selected peer session = 所選對象工作階段&#xa;whole topology = 整體拓樸&#xa;current BLE-reachable peer = 目前 BLE 可達對象&#xa;Live BLE data = 第一手 BLE 資料&#xa;selected peer first-hand = 所選對象第一手資料&#xa;DEVICE_ALIAS = 裝置別名&#xa;adv_name = 廣播名稱&#xa;BLE MAC = BLE 位址 / MAC&#xa;Central / cache metadata = 中央 / 快取主資料&#xa;sync / cached context = 同步 / 快取背景&#xa;central_alias = 中央別名&#xa;cached_alias = 快取別名&#xa;central_ref = 中央參照 ID&#xa;App local state = App 本地狀態&#xa;local override / pending = 本地覆寫 / 待同步狀態&#xa;local_pending_alias = 本地待同步別名&#xa;stableId = 穩定識別碼&#xa;Relayed / cached names = 轉述 / 快取名稱&#xa;first-hand BLE observation = 第一手 BLE 觀測&#xa;Display Precedence = 顯示優先序&#xa;display name / display label = 顯示名稱&#xa;canonical identity = 正式身分&#xa;canonical id = 正式識別碼&#xa;transport identity = 傳輸身分&#xa;metadata = 主資料 / 描述資料&#xa;pending rename does not rewrite truth = 待同步 rename 不會改寫真值&#xa;tap selected peer = 點擊選定對象&#xa;current peer session = 當前對象工作階段&#xa;candidate names = 候選名稱&#xa;metadata if available = 若可用則帶入主資料&#xa;local override = 本地覆寫&#xa;keep identity separate = 保持身分分層分開&#xa;Chosen display label = 最終顯示名稱" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7d6;strokeColor=#c9a227;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#3b2f16;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
